[]i am looking for something definitive on what messages 
[]appear when you drop a certain ring in a sink.

someone previously posted spoilers to this effect, here's my list:
{{{ring/sink/messages spoilers follow}}}



rings                message description (not literal)
invisibility         you don't see anything happen to the sink
aggravate monster    flies buzz angrily
hunger               hear ring bouncing down the drain pipe
adornment            faucets flash brightly
stealth              sink seems to blend into the floor
polymorph control    momentarily looks like a regularly erupting geyser
shock resistance     static electricity
protection from shape changers    sink looks nothing like a fountain
increase damage      force seems greater
teleportation        sink momentarily vanishes
warning              the sink glows white
poison resistance    you smell rotten slime molds
gain strength        water flow seems greater
fire resistance      hot water faucet flashes brightly
polymorph            sink momentarily looks like a fountain
regeneration         sink looks as good as new
teleport control     the sink looks like it is being beamed aboard somewhere
cold resistance      cold water fauced flashes brightly
protection           glows silver
see invisible        see some air in the sink
levitation           sink quivers upward
searching            you thought it got lost in the sink but there it is
conflict             loud noises from the drain

